{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]In the year that King Uzzi[F]ah died
I saw the [Eb]Lord seated on a high and [Bb]lofty throne
And the [Gm]train of his robe [F]filled the tem[Bb]ple
Above him stood seraphim, each [Eb]with six wings
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Holy, [Gm]holy, [Eb]holy is [F]the LORD [Bb]of hosts
