Your [F]guilt is taken a[Eb]way, and your sin is ato[Bb]ned for
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Then I [Gm]heard the voice [F]of the [Eb]Lord saying
Whom shall [Gm]I send? And [F]who will go for [Eb]us?
And I said, Here I am. Send [Bb]me!
