{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
So [Bb]he went [Gm]out to a peo[F]ple who [Eb]would hear but never under[Bb]stand
He [Gm]spoke of a virgin's [F]son, a [Eb]sign from the Lord's own hand
Of a [Bb]child who [Gm]would be [F]born to us, [Eb]the Prince of [Gm]Peace
